A||||1||wallmic||Lost volumn in fuel tank?
Z||000000||wallmic||08-17-99||08:10 PM||||I run out of gas with the fuel gage at about 1/8 full.  When I refill, I can only get about 8.5 gallons in!  No apparent damage to the tank.  My guess is the tank suction line is lifted off the tank bottom.  Anyone seen this problem?  Any easy fix without removing the tank?
Z||000001||ezsurf||08-17-99||09:20 PM||||The vent line is probably not the problem.  Go to www.fiero.mn.org.  Go to the knowledge base page and look under tech tips - Misc.  Read "does your gas gauge lie to you."  I have the same problem.
